graph TD
    Company[公司 Company] -->|拥有| Warehouse[仓库 Warehouse]
    Company -->|设置| POSProfile[POS配置 POS Profile]
    
    Warehouse -->|存储| Item[商品 Item]
    Warehouse -->|库存数量| Bin[库位 Bin]
    
    Item -->|定价| ItemPrice[商品价格 Item Price]
    Item -->|批次管理| Batch[批次 Batch]
    Item -->|所属| ItemGroup[商品分组 Item Group]
    
    Customer[客户 Customer] -->|关联| CustomerGroup[客户分组]
    Customer -->|参与| LoyaltyProgram[积分计划 Loyalty Program]
    
    POSProfile -->|配置| POSInvoice[POS单据 POS Invoice]
    Customer -->|购买| POSInvoice
    Item -->|销售项| POSInvoice
    
    POSInvoice -->|生成| StockLedger[库存分录<br/>Stock Ledger Entry]
    POSInvoice -->|生成| GLEntry[总账分录<br/>GL Entry]
    POSInvoice -->|支付| PaymentEntry[付款分录<br/>Payment Entry]
    POSInvoice -->|积分| LoyaltyPoint[积分分录<br/>Loyalty Point Entry]
    
    StockLedger -->|更新| Bin
    GLEntry -->|记入| Account[会计科目 Account]
    
    style POSInvoice fill:#ffcdd2
    style StockLedger fill:#c8e6c9
    style GLEntry fill:#bbdefb
    style PaymentEntry fill:#fff9c4
